    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Array rearrangement</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Reverse trick</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/next-permutation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 31</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Next Permutation</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The longest non-increasing suffix is already at its maximum, so the change must happen just before it. Bump that pivot to the smallest bigger value from the suffix, then reverse the suffix to make it as small as possible. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
